WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.481 --> 00:00:03.651
查看三项Privacy默认值 / Inspect all three Privacy defaults

2
00:00:03.651 --> 00:00:06.663
更改Authorization默认值 / Change the Authorization default

3
00:00:06.663 --> 00:00:09.676
更改Cookie默认值 / Change the Cookie default

4
00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:13.782
打开新HAR草稿核对继承 / Open a new HAR draft and verify inherited defaults

5
00:00:13.782 --> 00:00:37.513
本次只遮罩Authorization / Mask Authorization for this export only

6
00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:42.649
保存guide-auth-masked.har / Save guide-auth-masked.har

7
00:00:42.649 --> 00:00:45.793
核对文件只遮罩指定字段 / Verify only the selected fields are masked

8
00:00:45.793 --> 00:00:48.918
核对单次覆盖没改全局默认值 / Verify the per-export override did not change defaults

9
00:00:48.918 --> 00:00:51.940
关闭未遮罩前的警示偏好 / Disable the unmasked-export warning preference

10
00:00:51.940 --> 00:01:17.499
查看新的公开数据导出草稿 / Inspect the new public-data export draft

11
00:01:17.499 --> 00:01:23.082
只保存本轮公开测试值 / Save only this run’s public example values

12
00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:26.210
核对取消遮罩后文件的真实字段 / Verify the actual unmasked exported fields

13
00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:29.317
返回Privacy恢复默认值 / Return to Privacy to restore defaults

14
00:01:29.317 --> 00:01:32.332
恢复Authorization遮罩 / Restore Authorization masking

15
00:01:32.332 --> 00:01:35.339
恢复Cookie遮罩 / Restore Cookie masking

16
00:01:35.339 --> 00:01:38.358
恢复未遮罩警示 / Restore the unmasked-export warning

17
00:01:38.358 --> 00:01:42.552
检查新草稿使用恢复后的默认值 / Inspect a new draft with restored defaults

18
00:01:42.552 --> 00:02:07.046
本次移除请求与响应正文 / Remove request and response bodies for this export

19
00:02:07.046 --> 00:02:12.676
保存guide-redacted-no-body.har / Save guide-redacted-no-body.har

20
00:02:12.676 --> 00:02:15.727
逐字段核对真正的文件内容 / Verify the actual file field by field

21
00:02:15.727 --> 00:02:18.763
清空本轮临时记录再检查导入 / Clear this run’s temporary records before checking import

22
00:02:18.763 --> 00:02:37.575
从产品选择刚导出的HAR / Select the just-exported HAR through the product

23
00:02:37.575 --> 00:02:43.133
打开本轮去正文HAR / Open this run’s body-stripped HAR

24
00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:47.147
导入不会凭空恢复已移除正文 / Import does not recreate removed body bytes
